# CorePrivateWarriorCastDDMagicAggressive (29008, Death Wraith, level 55, DD magic 4001-5), every draw 0:
# a level 70 character, more than 8 levels above it, that hits it is cursed (4515-1) at 1000000 and
# adds no hate; a mate of level 40 is not. Perum (29012, level 48, DD 4001-4) has the same hooks and
# a hate shuffle timer (4001), every 90 to 330 s.
character Hunter 70
roll player 0
random always 0
member Mate 40 -1500 0 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastDDMagic.WarriorCastDDMagic
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastDDMagic.WarriorCastDDMagicAggressive
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastDDMagic.CorePrivateWarriorCastDDMagicAggressive.CorePrivateWarriorCastDDMagicAggressive
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastDDMagic.CorePrivateWarriorCastDDMagicAggressive.CorePrivatePerum
npc wraith 29008 Monster 300 0 0 level 55 skill DD_MAGIC 4001 5 skill DEBUFF1 4515 1
npc perum 29012 Monster 300 600 0 level 48 skill DD_MAGIC 4001 4 skill DEBUFF1 4515 1

hit wraith 10 by Mate
  desires wraith -
hit wraith 10
  desires wraith cast(player,4515:1,move)=1000000
hit perum 10 by Mate
  desires perum -
hit perum 10
  desires perum cast(player,4515,move)=1000000
